---

<section id="cta" class="bg-df-bg dark:bg-df-bg-dark px-4 py-20 sm:px-8">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
		<div
			class="from-df-primary to-df-accent dark:from-df-primary-dark dark:to-df-accent-dark relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br via-violet-600 px-6 py-12 text-center sm:px-12 sm:py-16 dark:via-violet-700"
		>
			<!-- Background image subtle -->
			<img
				src="/minimal_serenity.png"
				alt=""
				class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-10 mix-blend-overlay"
				aria-hidden="true"
			/>

			<div class="relative z-10">
				<h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl leading-tight font-black text-white md:text-4xl">
					Crea un board que puedas usar de verdad.
				</h2>
				<p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">
					Explora imágenes, diseña tu lienzo y exporta en alta calidad para compartir o imprimir —
					sin crear una cuenta.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
					<a
						href="/explore"
						class="text-df-primary rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold shadow-lg transition-colors hover:bg-gray-50"
					>
						Empezar ahora
					</a>
					<a
						href="/export"
						class="rounded-full border-2 border-white/50 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10"
					>
						Ver opciones de exportación
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
